{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2022-11-15 10:35:00', 'title': 'ON UTILITY SCAM AWARENESS DAY, PG&E WANTS TO HELP CUSTOMERS RECOGNIZE AND AVOID UTILITY SCAMS', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AS THE NUMBER OF SCAMS TARGETING UTILITY CUSTOMERS CONTINUE AT AN ALARMING RATE, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) IS JOINING UTILITIES UNITED AGAINST SCAMS TO HELP CUSTOMERS RECOGNIZE POTENTIAL SCAMS AS PART OF UTILITY SCAM AWARENESS DAY ON NOVEMBER 16.'}